      "clause": "2.1",
      "title": "Sizes",
      "text": "2.1 Sizes — (i) 100 × 100 mm or 98.5 × 98.5 mm (ii) 150 × 150 mm or 148.5 × 148.5 mm and (iii)   200 × 200 mm or 198.5 mm × 198.5 mm",
