    {
      "is": "IS 4457:1982",
      "clause": "3",
      "title": "Requirements",
      "text": "3. Requirements TABLE 1 REQUIREMENT OF CERAMIC UN- GLAZED VITREOUS ACID  RESISTING TILES Sl. No.       Characteristic                      Requirement (1) (2) (3) i) Squareness The gap between the inner edge of the square and the adjacent side of the tile shall not exceed 1 mm per100 mm run ii) Warpage for  size(i) ± 1.5 mm for  size(ii) ± 2.0 mm for  size(iii) ± 2.5 mm iii) Water absorption 2 percent, Max iv) Compressive strength 70 N/mm 2 (700 kgf/ cm2),  Min v) Flexural strength 20 N/mm2(200kgf/ cm2), Min vi) Resistance to acid Loss in mass shall not exceed 1.5  percent vii) Abrasion resistance i)  Average wear 2 mm, Max ii) Wear on individual specimen 2.5mm, Max.",
